    "catalogue_description": "This is another map i was working on before my PC Died. Thanks to MRQuick i have a copy of the beta of this map which i can now release so anyone who wants to play it, can. Description: This Is a one room map, Ported directly from Super Mario 64. It is not a \u201cremake\u201d. The Map is a model ported to WAW by me. I hadn\u2019t gotten around to adding any more Rooms, so thats why its one room. Map Uses the ZCT MW Mod. I have also added a model of dead Mario, and dead Yoshi. Features: Custom Models ZCT MW Mod Custom Mystery Box So yeah, It\u2019s not much, but it\u2019s something playable that i have managed to recover with the hep of Mr Quick.",
